{"schemaVersion":"uapt-school-change-events-v2","revision":"v6-qs101-120-presentation-20261028","slug":"ahmadu-bello-university-zaria","basisSha256":"86f34606cfb89445028c2a6b3f137815945958bd08b67006ac8bcd6a423bd44d","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","currentClaimIds":[],"themeOrder":[],"events":[{"id":"ahmadu-bello-university-zaria:public-release-20260612-001","slug":"ahmadu-bello-university-zaria","revision":"public-release-20260612-001","previousRevision":"public-release-20260526-003","publishedAt":"2026-06-12T12:35:00.000Z","url":"/changes/public-release-20260612-001/ahmadu-bello-university-zaria","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"claim:claim-abu-ai-assessment-originality-context-20260612","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-abu-ai-assessment-originality-context-20260612","matchMethod":"none","newText":"An official ABU conference news page reports a keynote statement that tools like ChatGPT can complete assignments instantly and challenge assessment and originality, but it does not state an ABU rule permitting or prohibiting student AI-tool use.","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/abu-will-continue-to-support-individuals-and-groups-in-advancing-ai-in-learning/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-abu-ai-policy-source-status-20260612","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-abu-ai-policy-source-status-20260612","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The crawl found official ABU pages discussing AI strategies and teaching/learning context, but did not find a public official ABU generative-AI use policy, approved/prohibited AI tools list, or AI-tool data/security policy.","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/how-to-navigate-challenges-posed-by-artificial-intelligence-in-abu-by-vice-chancellor/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-abu-ai-teaching-strategy-context-20260612","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-abu-ai-teaching-strategy-context-20260612","matchMethod":"none","newText":"Official ABU news pages say university leaders discussed updating teaching and learning policy for AI transparency/accountability and later stated that ABU had put strategies in place for use of AI in teaching and learning; the pages do not publish the full strategy or student-use rules.","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/artificial-intelligence-key-pillar-in-abus-strategic-goal-says-vice-chancellor/","https://abu.edu.ng/how-to-navigate-challenges-posed-by-artificial-intelligence-in-abu-by-vice-chancellor/"]},{"id":"claim:claim-abu-research-data-handling-context-20260612","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"privacy","claimId":"claim-abu-research-data-handling-context-20260612","matchMethod":"none","newText":"ABU's Research Policy assigns responsibility for research data collection, management, storage, and retention in research projects; the source does not state AI-tool-specific privacy or security rules.","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/abu-research-policy.pdf"]},{"id":"claim:claim-abu-research-integrity-context-20260612","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-abu-research-integrity-context-20260612","matchMethod":"none","newText":"ABU's Research Policy is described as university-wide for research practice and defines plagiarism as research ethical misconduct; this is adjacent research-integrity context and not AI-specific guidance.","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/abu-research-policy.pdf"]},{"id":"source_added:https://abu.edu.ng/abu-will-continue-to-support-individuals-and-groups-in-advancing-ai-in-learning/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://abu.edu.ng/abu-will-continue-to-support-individuals-and-groups-in-advancing-ai-in-learning/"]},{"id":"source_added:https://abu.edu.ng/artificial-intelligence-key-pillar-in-abus-strategic-goal-says-vice-chancellor/","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMet